## Next: Adding Support for New Document Formats

If your source uses a format other than markdown (e.g., Confluence XHTML, Sphinx RST), you'll also need to add a [Parser](./extending-parsers.html) to convert it to MDAST.

The full pipeline is: **Connector** (fetch) → **Parser** (convert to MDAST) → **Transforms** (enrich) → **Renderer** (output markdown).
